      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎬 First Block: Video Generation Flow\n\n## 1. **Input Form:** \n ### User provides a basic prompt describing the desired video.\n\n## 2. **Char Model (Prompt Refiner):**\n ### This AI model enhances and restructures the basic prompt into a clear, detailed, and HeyGen-optimized prompt.\n\n## 3. **HTTP Node (HeyGen API):** \n###  The refined prompt is sent to the HeyGen API, which generates the final AI video.\n",
        "height": 880,
        "width": 752
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -208
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "c149769f-116f-4a80-8e0d-8d2989ad5625",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎬 Second Block: Video Retrieval Flow\n\n## 1. **Wait Node:** \n ### Pauses the workflow for 200 seconds to allow the video generation to complete.\n\n## 2. **HTTP Node:**\n ### Fetches the generated video from HeyGen using the video ID.\n\n## 3. **Switch Node:** \n### - If the video is ready → continue the workflow.\n### - If the video generation failed → stop the workflow & informs the user.\n###  - If the video is still processing → wait another 200 seconds and retry.",
        "height": 768,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        752,
        -288
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "ef55ee89-d540-4c23-b7f9-60fc32d2c91f",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎬 Third Block: Title Generation\n\n### Generates a clear and catchy title using the previously refined prompt.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 336,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1424,
        -368
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "cf2e91ad-b8be-4f28-b55a-3439efd23b01",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎬 Fourth Block: Video Upload Flow\n\n## 1. **HTTP Node:** \n ### Converts the generated video into binary format, as YouTube requires binary files for uploads. file\n## 2. **YouTube Node:**\n ### Uploads the video to the specified YouTube channel.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1792,
        -480
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "4251689d-1d2a-4dfe-8652-1e1f785f5dfd",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎬 Fifth Block: Notifications & Storage\n\n## 1. **Google Sheets Node:** \n ### Stores video metadata and relevant workflow information for record-keeping.\n\n## 2. **WhatsApp Node:**\n ### Sends an automated message notifying that the video has been successfully uploaded.\n\n## 3. **Email Node:** \n###  Sends an email notification about the video upload to specified recipients.\n",
